        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Dildarian, Mia Tyler\n- Television Series: The Life & Times of Tim\n- Roles: creator, writer, producer, voice actor, actress, model, fashion designer, advertising copywriter\n- Places: New York City\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Dildarian was born on November 3, 1969.\n- Mia Abagale Tallarico, better known as Mia Tyler, was born on December 22, 1978.\n- Steve Dildarian is an American former advertising copywriter.\n- Mia Tyler is an American actress, model, and fashion designer.\n- Steve Dildarian created The Life & Times of Tim.\n- Steve Dildarian was the creator, writer, producer, and voice of Tim in the HBO animated television series The Life & Times of Tim.\n- The Life & Times of Tim aired from 2008 to 2012.\n- The Life & Times of Tim is about Tim, a hapless man in his mid-20s who lives in New York City with his girlfriend Amy.\n- Steve Dildarian voiced the character Tim in The Life & Times of Tim.",
